        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Guildford, Surrey, England, London\n- Organizations: Guildford Cathedral, St Paul's Cathedral, Diocese of London\n- People: Dennis Huntley, Bishop of London\n- Topics: Anglican cathedrals, sculpture\n\nFacts:\n- Guildford Cathedral, formally the Cathedral Church of the Holy Spirit, Guildford, is an Anglican cathedral in Guildford, Surrey, England.\n- St Paul's Cathedral is an Anglican cathedral in London and serves as the seat of the Bishop of London.\n- St Paul's Cathedral is the mother church of the Diocese of London.\n- Dennis Huntley is notable for creating sculptures for Guildford Cathedral.",
